        "original_id": "8022d142-29f2-5b73-9a25-a0f726e7bbd4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, Sonali Bendre, Anu Malik, Aadesh Shrivastava\n- Films: Angaaray, Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Barood, Zulmi, Kash Aap Hamare Hote\n- Topics: film music, box office performance, death\n\nFacts:\n- In 1998, the film Angaaray starred Akshay Kumar, Nagarjuna, Pooja Bhatt, and Sonali Bendre in lead roles.\n- In 1998, the film Angaaray had music composed by Anu Malik and Aadesh Shrivastava.\n- In the 1990s, Akshay Kumar's films Lahu Ke Do Rang, Insaaf, Daava, Tarazu, Angaaray, Barood, and Zulmi performed poorly at the box office, causing a setback in his film career.\n- The film Kash Aap Hamare Hote has original music by Aadesh Shrivastava.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer at Kokilaben Hospital one day after turning 51.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
